[00:17.86]To whom do you belong?
[00:22.02]Which god do you now obey?
[00:26.36]Your master’s the one to whom you bow.
[00:30.40]He is your god; you serve him now.
[00:35.10]You cannot serve two gods;
[00:39.48]Devotion cannot be shared.
[00:43.82]And so in the end your choice will depend
[00:48.04]On how your heart is prepared.
[00:52.93]To whom do you belong?
[00:58.70]Which god will you now obey?
[01:03.05]For one god is false and one is true,
[01:07.58]So make your choice; it’s up to you.
[01:12.24]Will Caesar of this world
[01:15.08]Possess your allegiance still?
[01:20.88]Or will you obey the true God today
[01:24.78]By always doing his will?
[01:32.18]To whom do I belong?
[02:08.56]Jehovah I will obey.
[02:13.24]My Father in heaven I will serve;
[02:17.42]I’ll pay my vows without reserve.
[02:21.98]He bought me at great cost;
[02:26.46]Devoted to him I’ll stay.
[02:30.78]To him I will give each moment I live.
[02:34.88]His name I’ll honor each day.
